00:06:08.467 --> 00:06:09.227
And that is it,

00:06:09.367 --> 00:06:11.367
that is the complete Krea 2 workflow.

00:06:11.587 --> 00:06:14.847
One canvas with real 4K,
eyes that finally look real,

00:06:14.847 --> 00:06:17.047
and all of it for free on our Instagram.

00:06:17.247 --> 00:06:19.527
If this video helped you,
leave a like and subscribe,

